NAME
    pal - dump color palettes from the attached core

SYNOPSIS
    pal [<index>]

DESCRIPTION
    Prints every color palette reported by the attached core as hex RRGGBB
    color triples, or prints only palette <index> when given.

EXAMPLES
    pal
    pal 3

EXIT STATUS
    0   Palette output printed (or refusal if core exposes no palettes).
    1   No target attached, invalid index, or session service fault.

SEE ALSO
    tile(1), tilemap(1), sprites(1), regs(1)
